<title>POLAND: CA-LEASING POLSKA ISSUE PLN 2 MLN THREE-MONTH CPS.</title>
<headline>CA-LEASING POLSKA ISSUE PLN 2 MLN THREE-MONTH CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warsaw-based CA-Leasing Polska Sp. zoo issued two million zlotys worth of 3-month commercial papers to domestic investors, the issue's agent Creditanstalt Securities SA said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The April 4 tender was part of CA-Leasing's 100 million zloty issue plan.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
